nativmix (1.0.17) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: V-Sink loopback passes explicit sink= to hardware output — stops
    WirePlumber retry loop (No input node for loopback-*) that broke V-Sink
    and Twitch audio during gaming; stale loopbacks are reloaded on audit/hotplug
  * Fix: quiet expected TypeError when Arduino serial is closed mid-readline
    during PrepareForSleep

