nativmix (1.0.14) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix: skip redundant Pulse volume writes — GNOME Shell FIFO accumulation (fixes #19)
  * Fix: reuse persistent Pulse connection for hardware volume during Arduino/MIDI ticks
  * Fix: discard transient Arduino reconnect frames with mismatched channel counts
  * Fix: volume sliders show saved positions after tray close and reopen (fixes #17)
  * Feat: optional MIDI fader feedback — outbound CC sync (opt-in via settings)
  * Feat: NativMix MIDI controller example sketch (arduino/)

 -- Christian Möllmann <moellix@knoellix.net>  Fri, 30 May 2026 12:00:00 +0200

nativmix (1.0.9) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Compact Mode — fader-only collapse view
  * MIDI Mute-CC — assign MIDI button to channel mute toggle
  * Edit MIDI Channel toggle — show/hide Learn/Delete buttons per channel
  * nativmix --restart IPC command
  * Auto-restart after package update
  * PipeWire reconnect + V-Sink recovery after restart
  * Fix: MIDI channel Delete button (silent TypeError)
  * Fix: Edit MIDI mode preserved after add/delete
  * Fix: Cancel MIDI learn via Escape or re-click
  * Fix: Windows — System Master AttributeError on first use
  * Fix: Windows — audio thread zombie after stop() timeout
  * Fix: IPC socket moved to XDG_RUNTIME_DIR
  * Perf: skip MIDI widgets in USB mode at startup

